      "updated": 1778862212154,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. Strategy for next week\n    -> 🧠 Array Pattern Practice List (Easy → Medium)\n\nThis is a very strong FAANG-style progression.\nFocus on:\n\npattern recognition\noptimization thinking\nclean implementation\n🔥 1. Traversal Pattern\nEasy\nFind Maximum Element\nFind Minimum Element\nCount Even/Odd Numbers\nCheck if Array Contains Element\nMedium\nBest Time to Buy and Sell Stock\nProduct of Array Except Self\n🔥 2. Two Pointer Pattern\nEasy\nTwo Sum II (sorted array)\nRemove Duplicates from Sorted Array\nValid Palindrome\nMedium\nContainer With Most Water\n3Sum\nSort Colors\nMove Zeroes\n🔥 3. Sliding Window Pattern\nEasy\nMaximum Average Subarray I\nMinimum Size Subarray Sum\nMedium\nLongest Substring Without Repeating Characters\nPermutation in String\nFruits Into Baskets\nLongest Repeating Character Replacement\n🔥 4. Prefix Sum Pattern\nEasy\nRunning Sum of 1D Array\nFind Pivot Index\nMedium\nSubarray Sum Equals K\nContinuous Subarray Sum\nRange Sum Query\n🔥 5. Hashing Pattern\nEasy\nTwo Sum\nContains Duplicate\nValid Anagram\nMedium\nGroup Anagrams\nTop K Frequent Elements\nLongest Consecutive Sequence\n🔥 6. Binary Search Pattern\nEasy\nBinary Search\nSearch Insert Position\nFirst Bad Version\nMedium\nFind Peak Element\nSearch in Rotated Sorted Array\nFind Minimum in Rotated Sorted Array\n🔥 7. Binary Search on Answer\nMedium\nKoko Eating Bananas\nCapacity To Ship Packages Within D Days\nSplit Array Largest Sum\nMinimize Maximum Distance to Gas Station\n🔥 8. Kadane Pattern\nEasy\nMaximum Subarray\nMedium\nMaximum Product Subarray\nCircular Subarray Sum\n🔥 9. Monotonic Stack Pattern\nEasy\nNext Greater Element I\nMedium\nDaily Temperatures\nStock Span Problem\nLargest Rectangle in Histogram\n🔥 10. Monotonic Queue Pattern\nMedium\nSliding Window Maximum\nShortest Subarray with Sum at Least K\n🔥 11. Fast & Slow Pointer Pattern\nEasy\nMiddle of Linked List\nLinked List Cycle\nMedium\nFind Duplicate Number\nHappy Number\n🔥 12. Greedy Pattern\nEasy\nAssign Cookies\nCan Place Flowers\nMedium\nJump Game\nGas Station\nPartition Labels\n🔥 13. Overlapping Intervals Pattern\nMedium\nMerge Intervals\nInsert Interval\nNon-overlapping Intervals\nMeeting Rooms\n🔥 14. Top K Elements Pattern\nEasy\nKth Largest Element in Stream\nMedium\nK Closest Points to Origin\nTop K Frequent Elements\nFind Kth Largest Element in Array\n🔥 15. Matrix Traversal Pattern\nEasy\nReshape Matrix\nTranspose Matrix\nMedium\nSpiral Matrix\nSet Matrix Zeroes\nRotate Image\nWord Search\n🔥 16. Backtracking on Arrays\nEasy\nSubsets\nMedium\nPermutations\nCombination Sum\nSubsets II\n🔥 17. DP on Arrays\nEasy\nClimbing Stairs\nMin Cost Climbing Stairs\nMedium\nHouse Robber\nHouse Robber II\nJump Game\nJump Game II\nCoin Change\nLongest Increasing Subsequence\nPartition Equal Subset Sum\n🔥 18. Sorting + Greedy Pattern\nEasy\nMinimum Absolute Difference\nMedium\nMerge Intervals\nQueue Reconstruction by Height\nMeeting Rooms II\n🎯 BEST ORDER TO PRACTICE\n\nFollow this order:\n\nTraversal\nHashing\nTwo Pointer\nSliding Window\nPrefix Sum\nBinary Search\nKadane\nMonotonic Stack\nGreedy\nDP\nBacktracking\n🔥 IMPORTANT PRACTICE STRATEGY\n\nFor EVERY problem:\n\nStep 1\n\nWrite brute force first.\n\nStep 2\n\nAsk:\n\nCan I:\n- reduce nested loops?\n- use hashing?\n- use pointers?\n- reuse computations?\nStep 3\n\nIdentify pattern trigger.\n\nExample:\n\nContiguous + optimize\n    -> Sliding Window\nStep 4\n\nRe-solve after 2–3 days.\n\nThis is critical.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. Strategy for next week\n    -> 🧠 Array Pattern Practice List (Easy → Medium)\n\nThis is a very strong FAANG-style progression.\nFocus on:\n\npattern recognition\noptimization thinking\nclean implementation\n🔥 1. Traversal Pattern\nEasy\nFind Maximum Element\nFind Minimum Element\nCount Even/Odd Numbers\nCheck if Array Contains Element\nMedium\nBest Time to Buy and Sell Stock\nProduct of Array Except Self\n🔥 2. Two Pointer Pattern\nEasy\nTwo Sum II (sorted array)\nRemove Duplicates from Sorted Array\nValid Palindrome\nMedium\nContainer With Most Water\n3Sum\nSort Colors\nMove Zeroes\n🔥 3. Sliding Window Pattern\nEasy\nMaximum Average Subarray I\nMinimum Size Subarray Sum\nMedium\nLongest Substring Without Repeating Characters\nPermutation in String\nFruits Into Baskets\nLongest Repeating Character Replacement\n🔥 4. Prefix Sum Pattern\nEasy\nRunning Sum of 1D Array\nFind Pivot Index\nMedium\nSubarray Sum Equals K\nContinuous Subarray Sum\nRange Sum Query\n🔥 5. Hashing Pattern\nEasy\nTwo Sum\nContains Duplicate\nValid Anagram\nMedium\nGroup Anagrams\nTop K Frequent Elements\nLongest Consecutive Sequence\n🔥 6. Binary Search Pattern\nEasy\nBinary Search\nSearch Insert Position\nFirst Bad Version\nMedium\nFind Peak Element\nSearch in Rotated Sorted Array\nFind Minimum in Rotated Sorted Array\n🔥 7. Binary Search on Answer\nMedium\nKoko Eating Bananas\nCapacity To Ship Packages Within D Days\nSplit Array Largest Sum\nMinimize Maximum Distance to Gas Station\n🔥 8. Kadane Pattern\nEasy\nMaximum Subarray\nMedium\nMaximum Product Subarray\nCircular Subarray Sum\n🔥 9. Monotonic Stack Pattern\nEasy\nNext Greater Element I\nMedium\nDaily Temperatures\nStock Span Problem\nLargest Rectangle in Histogram\n🔥 10. Monotonic Queue Pattern\nMedium\nSliding Window Maximum\nShortest Subarray with Sum at Least K\n🔥 11. Fast & Slow Pointer Pattern\nEasy\nMiddle of Linked List\nLinked List Cycle\nMedium\nFind Duplicate Number\nHappy Number\n🔥 12. Greedy Pattern\nEasy\nAssign Cookies\nCan Place Flowers\nMedium\nJump Game\nGas Station\nPartition Labels\n🔥 13. Overlapping Intervals Pattern\nMedium\nMerge Intervals\nInsert Interval\nNon-overlapping Intervals\nMeeting Rooms\n🔥 14. Top K Elements Pattern\nEasy\nKth Largest Element in Stream\nMedium\nK Closest Points to Origin\nTop K Frequent Elements\nFind Kth Largest Element in Array\n🔥 15. Matrix Traversal Pattern\nEasy\nReshape Matrix\nTranspose Matrix\nMedium\nSpiral Matrix\nSet Matrix Zeroes\nRotate Image\nWord Search\n🔥 16. Backtracking on Arrays\nEasy\nSubsets\nMedium\nPermutations\nCombination Sum\nSubsets II\n🔥 17. DP on Arrays\nEasy\nClimbing Stairs\nMin Cost Climbing Stairs\nMedium\nHouse Robber\nHouse Robber II\nJump Game\nJump Game II\nCoin Change\nLongest Increasing Subsequence\nPartition Equal Subset Sum\n🔥 18. Sorting + Greedy Pattern\nEasy\nMinimum Absolute Difference\nMedium\nMerge Intervals\nQueue Reconstruction by Height\nMeeting Rooms II\n🎯 BEST ORDER TO PRACTICE\n\nFollow this order:\n\nTraversal\nHashing\nTwo Pointer\nSliding Window\nPrefix Sum\nBinary Search\nKadane\nMonotonic Stack\nGreedy\nDP\nBacktracking\n🔥 IMPORTANT PRACTICE STRATEGY\n\nFor EVERY problem:\n\nStep 1\n\nWrite brute force first.\n\nStep 2\n\nAsk:\n\nCan I:\n- reduce nested loops?\n- use hashing?\n- use pointers?\n- reuse computations?\nStep 3\n\nIdentify pattern trigger.\n\nExample:\n\nContiguous + optimize\n    -> Sliding Window\nStep 4\n\nRe-solve after 2–3 days.\n\nThis is critical.",
